                <h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="FPar1">Funding</h3>
                <p>This study was supported by the National Space Biomedical Research Institute [RE03701 through NCC 9–58] and the NIH National Center for Advancing Translational Science (NCATS) UCLA CTSI Grant Number UL1TR00188. The authors would also like to acknowledge the Metabolomics Shared Resource in Georgetown University (Washington DC, USA) partially supported by NIH/NCI/CCSG grant P30-CA051008.</p>
              
                <h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="FPar2">Availability of data and materials</h3>
                <p>Raw sequencing files and associated metadata have been deposited in NCBI’s Sequence Read Archive (accession SRP098151), <a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sra">https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sra</a>. LC-MS metabolomics data will be made available on Dryad, <a href="http://datadryad.org">http://datadryad.org</a>/.</p>
              </div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="author-information" data-title="Author information"><div class="c-article-section" id="author-information-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="author-information">Author information</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="author-information-content"><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="affiliations">Authors and Affiliations</h3><ol class="c-article-author-affiliation__list"><li id="Aff1"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Department of Pathology and Laboratory Medicine, David Geffen School of Medicine, University of California, Los Angeles, Los Angeles, CA, 90095, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">David Casero &amp; Jonathan Braun</p></li><li id="Aff2"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Department of Oncology, Georgetown University Medical Center, Washington DC, 20057, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Kirandeep Gill &amp; Amrita K. Cheema</p></li><li id="Aff3"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Division of Radiation Health, University of Arkansas for Medical Sciences, Little Rock, AR, 72205, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Vijayalakshmi Sridharan, Martin Hauer-Jensen &amp; Marjan Boerma</p></li><li id="Aff4"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Department of Environmental and Occupational Health, University of Arkansas for Medical Sciences, Little Rock, AR, 72205, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Igor Koturbash</p></li><li id="Aff5"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Department of Radiation Medicine, Loma Linda University, Loma Linda, CA, 92350, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Gregory Nelson</p></li><li id="Aff6"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Department of Biochemistry and Molecular and &amp; Cellular Biol